WEBVTT

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:53.250
Every square inch of land is a garden, an expression of creation, efficiently built and designed to the best modern technology and craft of the day, from humans, handcrafted art, visions of beauty and dreams that come from the heart,

00:00:53.250 --> 00:01:11.570
and the mind and the soul when the eyes are closed, the house is quiet, and in the morning,

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:55.560
to a yard of care and responsibility and respect for all creation, one wild ride or display

00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:13.880
or participation in what I want to be when I grow up, to build wonder and excitement

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:27.140
and slow growth process for the brain and the family arts.

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:47.160
A deep respect for every walking, thinking, seeing, chirping, musical thing.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:12.340
An education that goes far enough for peaceful living

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:27.810
in humble craft or high design, all supporting a garden.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:04:05.690
understanding of the limited resources and the care and thought and need for all to consent

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.420
to usage of Earth's resources.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:59.920
We have time, we have technology, all we need is a truce, no more killing, no more speaking,

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:32.460
day of rest, but a day before that, a day of reflection and detective work to address

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.500
the people with nothing.
